{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>If</b> — with all his strength. The correct reading is that it is <i>shenat</i> (sleep of), and I have already stated my opinion regarding the word <b>שנת</b> — that it has a kamatz, like <b>עזי</b> and <b>זמרת יה</b>."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 132, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:32.684007234Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}